  "title": "Dendritic Integration Theory",
  "role": "model",
  "summary": "The dendritic integration theory of Jaan Aru, Mototaka Suzuki and Matthew Larkum: layer 5 pyramidal neurons couple the cortico-cortical loop that carries the contents of consciousness with the thalamo-cortical loop that sets its state. Coupling of their apical and basal compartments gates conscious processing, and anesthesia decouples them.",
